; info/squad/*(eng) : keys this mod changed or added
; mod part
; changed from vanilla
{"at_rifles(eng)" "This team of anti-tank infantrymen is equipped with a Boys anti-tank rifle, perfectly suited for taking out lightly armored enemy vehicles. While the high velocity rifle packs a punch, it is insufficient to take on heavier vehicles and it may require several shots to fully disable light vehicles."}
{"mgs2(eng)" "A Bren machine gun team and sandbags. Soldiers are skill 4."}
{"officers(eng)" "This experienced field officer is capable of supporting your troops by spotting enemy units from afar with his binoculars. Use his skill in locating enemy units through the fog of war, so that your other units can engage or avoid them as necessary. The officer also reduces your current CP by 20 which allows you to field a bigger army."}
; new
{"vehic_supporter(eng)" "This pair of support crews are only lightly armed but are well-suited for crewing your armored vehicles and field guns. Use them to replace the losses you have suffered in combat and re-man your equipment. They are not suited for infantry combat and can't capture points."}
{"elite_tankmans(eng)" "This pair of tank crews are only lightly armed but are well-suited for crewing your armored vehicles and field guns. Use them to replace the losses you have suffered in combat and re-man your equipment. They are not suited for infantry combat and can't capture points. They are the best of the Commonwealth so use them wisely!"}
{"stormtrooper5(eng)" "This team of anti-tank rocket-launcher infantrymen is armed with a PIAT and they are trained to destroy tanks in close combat by launching armor-piercing rounds. They are capable of destroying even the heaviest armored vehicles -- provided they can find a weakness to exploit. Beware of the armored skirts on some vehicles, as they greatly reduce the effectiveness of these shaped-charge rounds."}
{"elite3(eng)" "A Commando Bren machine gun team and sandbags. Soldiers are skill 6."}
{"stormtrooper6(eng)" "A SAS Commando Bren machine gun team and sandbags. Soldiers are skill 8."}
